{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_1199D121","title":"Harper Oisiris Fifth Meeting","entry":"Dlg_1199D121::entry","exit":"Dlg_1199D121::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_30A1A1A0","articyId":"72057752951743178","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"So... good news and bad news.","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So... good news and bad news.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":-300.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42581","byteOffset":30437368,"byteLength":376}},{"id":"DFr_670084EC","articyId":"72057752951743199","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"So I'm laying low and I'm pretty bored. That's why I started using my old silicon weaving skills to fix up busted clothing. You know, patch in smart-thread, reactive linings, little upgrades. People loved it.","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So I'm laying low and I'm pretty bored. That's why I started using my old silicon weaving skills to fix up busted clothing. You know, patch in smart-thread, reactive linings, little upgrades. People loved it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":300.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24852","byteOffset":17281456,"byteLength":516}},{"id":"DFr_30E31BBC","articyId":"72057752951743212","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"Well... I stitched a jacket for this guy — just a regular patch job — and the next day, he swore the jacket \"spoke\" to him. Like, full sentences. Encouraging him to \"shed his skin\" and \"become one with the fabric.\"","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well... I stitched a jacket for this guy — just a regular patch job — and the next day, he swore the jacket \"spoke\" to him. Like, full sentences. Encouraging him to \"shed his skin\" and \"become one with the fabric.\"","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":900.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36980","byteOffset":28333080,"byteLength":528}},{"id":"DFr_2BA818C8","articyId":"72057752951743220","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"I thought so too, until three more people came back saying their clothes started... whispering. Telling them secrets. One woman said her socks told her the future. Correctly.","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I thought so too, until three more people came back saying their clothes started... whispering. Telling them secrets. One woman said her socks told her the future. Correctly.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1500.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43628","byteOffset":30833624,"byteLength":520}},{"id":"DFr_F6DFB90D","articyId":"72057752951743242","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"I only patched holes! I don't even know how to program prophecy socks!","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I only patched holes! I don't even know how to program prophecy socks!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":2100.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21620","byteOffset":16069272,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_83D1E5C4","articyId":"72057752951743256","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"Yeah. I don't want to end up being known as the cursed tailor of Nivalis. I’m going back to something safer. Like, I dunno... mold testing. At least if things talk to you there, you expect it.","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah. I don't want to end up being known as the cursed tailor of Nivalis. I’m going back to something safer. Like, I dunno... mold testing. At least if things talk to you there, you expect it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2700.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41662","byteOffset":30089912,"byteLength":540}},{"id":"DFr_234D0BD2","articyId":"72057752951743277","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"One guy did. Showed up to the market wrapped head-to-toe in stitched-together scarves. Said he was the \"Chosen Loom.\" Security had to untangle him from the streetlights","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"One guy did. Showed up to the market wrapped head-to-toe in stitched-together scarves. Said he was the \"Chosen Loom.\" Security had to untangle him from the streetlights","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3300.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50141","byteOffset":33311160,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_17327AB6","articyId":"72057752951743292","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"Great. Just what I needed. First I moo like a cow, now I accidentally found a religion. I should just place a sign over my head: \"Hey, CorpSec! I'm here!\"","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Great. Just what I needed. First I moo like a cow, now I accidentally found a religion. I should just place a sign over my head: \"Hey, CorpSec! I'm here!\"","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":3950.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28505","byteOffset":18667464,"byteLength":464}},{"id":"DFr_42FF7D88","articyId":"72057752951743351","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"Gotta taste it. Only way to be sure.","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Gotta taste it. Only way to be sure.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3300.0,"y":825.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40786","byteOffset":29756592,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_63BD497A","articyId":"72057821671256173","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"I'm doing whatever I can to pass time till I hear from my brother. I know there's no news, but... have you heard ANYTHING?","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm doing whatever I can to pass time till I hear from my brother. I know there's no news, but... have you heard ANYTHING?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":4650.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50166","byteOffset":33320824,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_DAAE0ECE","articyId":"72057821671256192","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"Right. Damn ...","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Right. Damn ...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":5250.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51011","byteOffset":33638152,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_9B7D8800","articyId":"72057752951743185","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Hit me.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hit me.","TextSheVersion":"Hit me.","TextTheyVersion":"Hit me."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":0.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32969","byteOffset":20357664,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_D662CC6D","articyId":"72057752951743191","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Uh-oh.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Uh-oh.","TextSheVersion":"Uh-oh.","TextTheyVersion":"Uh-oh."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":0.0,"y":750.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22722","byteOffset":16481080,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_9221E96A","articyId":"72057752951743206","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Sounds like a solid gig. What's the bad news?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sounds like a solid gig. What's the bad news?","TextSheVersion":"Sounds like a solid gig. What's the bad news?","TextTheyVersion":"Sounds like a solid gig. What's the bad news?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":600.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33478","byteOffset":20549240,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_EE7ACBAC","articyId":"72057752951743227","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Maybe he was just messing with you.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Maybe he was just messing with you.","TextSheVersion":"Maybe he was just messing with you.","TextTheyVersion":"Maybe he was just messing with you."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39185","byteOffset":29156760,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_64D94806","articyId":"72057752951743235","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"...And you made these upgrades?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"...And you made these upgrades?","TextSheVersion":"...And you made these upgrades?","TextTheyVersion":"...And you made these upgrades?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39169","byteOffset":29151416,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_E5201816","articyId":"72057752951743249","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"So, are you giving it up?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So, are you giving it up?","TextSheVersion":"So, are you giving it up?","TextTheyVersion":"So, are you giving it up?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35271","byteOffset":25704424,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_DCF9285E","articyId":"72057752951743263","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"How do you test mold...","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"How do you test mold...","TextSheVersion":"How do you test mold...","TextTheyVersion":"How do you test mold..."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40968","byteOffset":29826560,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_8F6069CB","articyId":"720577